    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππεύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>riding</i> or <i>driving</i> of horses,
